  Output text is not logged. Verified entries for: echo, cd /tmp, pwd (x3) via ws.

All checks passed.

## 7. Real-terminal UI rework (2026-11-13)
Change: the append-only log view + bottom input box was replaced by a real
terminal UI, per the owner's decision. src/ui.html now contains a cell-grid
terminal emulator (TermCore, plain JavaScript, DOM text rendering — no
canvas) and direct key input on the output area (hidden textarea + IME
composition events, paste with bracketed-paste support, block cursor).
src/main.rs is unchanged.

Implemented control handling: CR/LF/BS/TAB, CSI cursor moves (A/B/C/D/E/F/
G/H/f/d/e/a/`), ED/EL modes 0-2 (+ED 3 clears scrollback), IL/DL/DCH/ICH/
ECH, SU/SD, CBT, REP, DECSTBM scroll region, insert mode (CSI 4), DECAWM
(?7), DECCKM app cursor keys (?1), cursor visibility (?25), alt screen
(?47/?1047/?1049 with cursor save/restore, ?1048), bracketed paste (?2004),
SGR incl. 256-color and truecolor, DEC special graphics charset, wide
(East Asian) characters, combining characters, DSR (CSI 6n / 5n) and primary
DA replies via the WS input channel. Mouse reporting modes are not handled.

